---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Plugins | Kreativ Sound"
  description="Kreativ Sound instrument and effect plugins are in development. Follow the direction, share your format needs, and get launch updates."
  canonical="https://kreativsound.com/plugins/"
  activeNav="plugins"
>
  <section class="card page-main plugins-page" aria-labelledby="plugins-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">Plugins</p>
    <h1 id="plugins-title" class="page-title">Plugins are in development. Help shape what launches first.</h1>
    <p class="page-lead">Kreativ Sound is exploring focused instruments and effects for atmospheric, cinematic, and textural work. Release dates are not announced yet; this page records the direction and gives you a direct way to share what would be useful.</p>
    <div class="plugins-page-status" aria-label="Plugin release status">
      <span>Early development</span>
      <p>Product pages, formats, demos, and release notes will appear here once a plugin is ready to evaluate publicly.</p>
    </div>
    <section class="plugins-roadmap" aria-label="Plugin direction">
      <article>
        <strong>Atmosphere-first instruments</strong>
        <p>Playable sources for drones, motion, unstable harmonics, and detailed background texture.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <strong>Practical effects</strong>
        <p>Focused processing for movement, degradation, space, and sound-design finishing rather than oversized suites.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <strong>Clear evaluation</strong>
        <p>Every public release will include format details, audio examples, support scope, and versioned release notes.</p>
      </article>
    </section>
    <section class="plugins-interest" aria-labelledby="plugins-interest-title">
      <h2 id="plugins-interest-title">Want a launch update or have a format request?</h2>
      <p>Email the tool, format, or workflow you want to see. This is also the best place to ask about beta evaluation when it opens.</p>
      <p><a class="button primary" href="mailto:info@kreativsound.com?subject=Plugin%20launch%20interest">Share plugin interest</a></p>
    </section>
    <div class="plugins-page-actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="/updates/">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-newspaper" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        View Updates
      </a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="/sounds/">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-wave-square" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        Browse Sounds
      </a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="/tools/">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        Browse Tools
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
